{"5051410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mistbound City", "steam_appid": 5051410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a content demo version. The demo includes the early-game content, allowing players to experience the main storyline, interactive gameplay and core features. The full release is scheduled for mid-September.<br>Mistbound City is a cinematic interactive mystery set in a rain-soaked city haunted by an unresolved case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an old manor shrouded in fog, search its rooms for clues, examine documents and environmental details, and question the people connected to the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation unfolds, every conversation and decision can reveal new information, change your relationships with other characters, and lead the story in a different direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who to trust, what to ask, and how far you are willing to go for the truth. The clues you uncover and the choices you make will shape how the mystery comes together—and determine the ending you reach.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a content demo version. The demo includes the early-game content, allowing players to experience the main storyline, interactive gameplay and core features. The full release is scheduled for mid-September.<br>Mistbound City is a cinematic interactive mystery set in a rain-soaked city haunted by an unresolved case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an old manor shrouded in fog, search its rooms for clues, examine documents and environmental details, and question the people connected to the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation unfolds, every conversation and decision can reveal new information, change your relationships with other characters, and lead the story in a different direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who to trust, what to ask, and h